==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sinner Snache]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Generalist midrangers and backliners such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] and [[Li'l Lizard Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l King Dragon Cat]] work wonders here like in the previous stage, but watch out for Sinner Snache's [[Death Surge]].

